  data: {
    LLM: '1. Standard shedding logic: Play a card (or set of equal cards) higher than the current top card.\n2. **The Tax (Skatt)**: Before play, the Peasant must give their two best cards (Aces/2s) to the King. The King gives back their two worst cards (low numerals). The Nobility and Burghers exchange one card similarly.',
